flowchart TD
    %% Sources: prope_source_of_truth.md 4.3, 10.5, S2/S7, H-05, Release 3; business-analysis.md FR-09/open questions.

    start([Start: production incident or recovery need])
    entry{Entry point}
    in_use[Running Revision Detail]
    history[Release History]
    permission{Permission to restore?\nRules: Unverified / TBD}
    denied[Access Unavailable]
    restore[Restore Previous Revision]
    emergency{Emergency bypass needed?}
    policy[Unverified / TBD: emergency restore and approval policy]
    approved{Selected revision is Approved?}
    warning[Select an Approved Revision]
    action[Restore Revision]
    result{Restore succeeds?\nFailure behavior: Unverified / TBD}
    failed[Unverified / TBD: Restore Failed]
    restored[In Use - Previous Revision Restored]
    restore_end([End: release history records restored revision])
    end_denied([End: restore not permitted])

    start --> entry
    entry -->|From running prompt| in_use
    entry -->|From release history| history
    in_use --> permission
    history --> permission
    permission -->|No| denied
    denied --> end_denied
    permission -->|Yes| restore
    restore --> emergency
    emergency -->|Yes| policy
    policy -->|Policy must be resolved before proceeding| restore
    emergency -->|No| approved
    approved -->|No| warning
    warning -->|Choose another revision| restore
    approved -->|Yes| action
    action --> result
    result -->|No| failed
    failed -->|Retry| restore
    failed -->|Cancel| history
    result -->|Yes| restored
    restored --> restore_end
